      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm such a drain on everyone. like, even when i'm not doing anything wrong, my presence just seems to weigh people down. every time i see them, i can tell they're just pretending to be okay with me, but i can see the exhaustion in their eyes. it feels like the kindest thing i could do is just stop being a burden and let them have their space back.",
